<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Practitioner Credentials</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <h2 style="color: #333333;">Welcome, <%= name %>!</h2>
    <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px;">
      An administrator has created an account for you as a Practitioner on our platform.
    </p>
    <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px;">
      Here are your login credentials:
    </p>
    <div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 15px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #333333;"><strong>Email:</strong> <%= email %></p>
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #333333;"><strong>Password:</strong> <%= password %></p>
    </div>
    <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px;">
      Your account is already verified, so you can log in directly. For security reasons, please consider changing your password after your first login.
    </p>
    <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px;">
      Best regards,<br>
      The Team
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
